00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:58.257
including his top campaign advisors,

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:00.493
Susie Wiles and Chris loss of Aida.

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:01.594
They will be traveling

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:03.463
by motorcade to the airport,

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:04.397
which is close by,

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:05.832
and then flying into LaGuardia

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:07.467
